utoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794160/extras/e8ec645603e533393d0de7cf21896e46.poster.avif?t=1753983344\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794160/extras/e8ec645603e533393d0de7cf21896e46.webm?t=1753983344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794160/extras/e8ec645603e533393d0de7cf21896e46.mp4?t=1753983344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794160/extras/2236ffea73fbef1af776883d252dbfc9.avif?t=1753983344\" width=501 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is still much to come in this upcoming project! Wishlist and support us in bringing to life this world of shifting tiles and mind-bending puzzles!</p>",
